                        11: a.i18n.gettext("South-Eastern Asia Nation. Encompassing most of Southeast Asia, Greater Thailand is poised for an alliance with either China or India. It has ample coastline and lots of jungle, making it a wise choice for intermediate players who favor naval, jungle and air warfare."),
